# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000047> (biological sex)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "MGED:MGED") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000047> "An organismal quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer's ability to undergo sexual reproduction in order to differentiate the individuals or types involved.")
